4
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:06,610
Apple Watch Ultra 4،

5
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:07,590
49mm، Titanium،

6
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:09,400
disponible دابا عندنا.

7
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:10,740
boîtier en titane

8
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:11,720
و écran saphir،

9
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,030
